stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unregistered
    Unregistered --> Active: Valid registration with required policy data
    Unregistered --> Unregistered: Invalid registration / reject
    Active --> Suspended: Authorized suspension with audit
    Suspended --> Suspended: Login or protected request / deny
    note right of Active
      Token expiry and playtime eligibility
      do not delete the account or its world.
    end note
